{"about_the_game":"<i>\u2026Bet your all, may victory be yours.</i><br><br>In this game, you adventure to become a successful gambler by challenging others at the game of Texas Hold\u2018em Poker.<br><br>Use various skills to achieve victory in poker, expose the hands of the witches, All-in to steal their winnings, and become the ruler of the gambling district.<br><br>\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Poker Battles</h2>An &quot;anything goes&quot; Texas Hold'em style 1v1 poker-like card game. <br>Become victorious by reducing the enemy chips to 0.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/0a6c794565358e8e65f88ad70e4bfd39.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/0a6c794565358e8e65f88ad70e4bfd39.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ACTIVATE SKILLS</strong></li></ul>The \u201cgambling prodigy\u201d Asuha is capable of turning the tides of battle using various skills, sourcing from her aptitude in gambling.<br>Limit the opponent\u2019s play, gain insight beyond their hand, and much more\u2026 stay victorious with skills that expand the pool of decision-making.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/73c5e4bad8345cbcca295eae8d9759d7.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/73c5e4bad8345cbcca295eae8d9759d7.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/0a1b9c76f5b90426ad0a94d04caeaf2d.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/0a1b9c76f5b90426ad0a94d04caeaf2d.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ALL-IN</strong></li></ul>\u201cAll-In\u201d is a command that puts all chips on the table and your life as a gambler on the line.<br>Use various means to put yourself in a favorable position, and use this command to slam the final nail in the coffin.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/affa16791d05a3f648fa05ede1c6d29b.poster.avif?t=1744618033\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/affa16791d05a3f648fa05ede1c6d29b.webm?t=1744618033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/affa16791d05a3f648fa05ede1c6d29b.mp4?t=1744618033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Showdown vs The Witches</h2>A \u201cWitch\u201d is a Boss Character present in each chapter of the game.<br>All Witches excel at poker, but with enough preparation, the player can expose the Witches\u2019 fraudulent acts and sink them to the depths of hell with a deadly All-In.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/cb19201ca346bea712b7ec7e79b28a7f.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/cb19201ca346bea712b7ec7e79b28a7f.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/e540a61b9002455b8ff4f89ecfc4f60a.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/e540a61b9002455b8ff4f89ecfc4f60a.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>THE CITY</strong></li></ul>The scene is set in The City, where various information can be gathered.<br>Find sources to help unveil the secrets behind the Witches\u2019 cheats and frauds to achieve sweet vengeance.<br>Additionally, you can hustle the gamblers around town to rake in quick cash, or go on a winning streak in \u201cPoker Royale\u201d\u2014which rewards you after achieving a set number of victories\u2014to earn the points needed for acquiring new skills and to obtain rare items, thereby increasing your standing as a gambler.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/62d57546696d38cde9244925c86bb87e.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/62d57546696d38cde9244925c86bb87e.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>The only appropriate sequel to cashing out, is to spend big. <br>Your earnings can be spent deservingly at &quot;club ALL OUT&quot; to party your heart out. <br>Should you catch lady luck's eye, you will be treated to bonus luck for your next battle.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>EXPOSE THE WITCHES\u2019 HAND</strong></li></ul>Your finesse in poker may earn you some cash in The City, but the Witches - who rule the districts, will not allow for a fair victory. Their methods of cheating seems to be fool-proof, but the evidence you uncover will say otherwise.<br>Explore every inch of the city and expose the cheaters of their tricks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/855e8b08e200dbac3ed5c9b12c04f02d.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/855e8b08e200dbac3ed5c9b12c04f02d.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/d4fa74b2949d50b64cec09b305372280.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/d4fa74b2949d50b64cec09b305372280.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>Asuha Senahara, a self-proclaimed genius gambler, is a wanderer.<br>Amidst the tables of cards and dice, it is she alone who snatches the chips at stake.<br>One day, she learns of the gambling district \u201cthe city\u201d, a special ward where gambling holds influence above all else.<br>In this city run by the strongest gamblers known as the \u201cWitches\u201d, Asuha experiences the first defeat in her life.<br>They exercised not luck, not skill, but dirty tricks, such that felled Asuha to the depths of the abyss.<br>As a self-proclaimed genius gambler, Asuha becomes determined to take down the Witches.<br>The Coliseum is the battlefield. The challenger is Asuha Senahara. The chips are on the table, and the Witches are ready to be exposed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Asuha Senahara</strong></li></ul>Self-proclaimed genius gambler. A failure of a human being, but has a strong resolve and is determined when it comes to gambling. A pretty young lady on the cover, a middle-aged old man on the inside.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/13fa6ac47e26a6510814ae49011176da.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/13fa6ac47e26a6510814ae49011176da.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=986 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Mina Nosaka</strong></li></ul>A girl who saved Asuha after her defeat against the witch.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/19c5ad22c2be6a35db3a07717138ee97.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/19c5ad22c2be6a35db3a07717138ee97.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=1133 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Ulu Amamino</strong></li></ul>The First Witch. Uses her mysterious powers to easily defeat Asuha.<br>Loves snacks and sweets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/ca81f625a7ddaedd5db1b605470015d9.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/ca81f625a7ddaedd5db1b605470015d9.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=1133 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Yuragi Tenraku</strong></li></ul>The Second Witch. Full of maternal warmth, yet subtly tinged with madness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/61fc8e070cb4ef64e3e227af88002112.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/61fc8e070cb4ef64e3e227af88002112.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=1133 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Lancille Kareido</strong></li></ul>The Third Witch. A lively and outgoing personality, embodying the ultimate &quot;gal&quot; vibe. <br>Serves as the warden of a forced labor facility.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/58e3dc53290fd513cf3da3e087b62559.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/58e3dc53290fd513cf3da3e087b62559.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=1133 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><strong>Planning &amp; Development</strong> ACQUIRE (developers of \u201cOctopath Traveler\u201d)<br><strong>Scenario</strong> Shusei Sakagami (Scenario of \u201cHeaven Burns Red\u201d)<br><strong>Art/b] \u85e4\u7530\u5ddd\u6674\u662d<br><strong>BGM</strong>\u3000Feryquitous<br><strong>Production</strong> WSS Playground (Planning &amp; Production of \u201cNEEDY STREAMER OVERLOAD\u201d)</strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The World's Prettiest Gambler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514640/5543d8c588f20fd2ce4480fc016e43244f74ca66.jpg"},{"name":"The Witch of Sweets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514640/724e3f6186516a176474e8fa78ff66258729e4aa.jpg"},{"name":"The Witch of Quietus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514640/5a97893d6077fe13a9479f48de236e84b930b87a.jpg"},{"name":"The Witch of Divine Sight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514640/75f14891ddb3266be9451e165e83f123691c7ca5.jpg"},{"name":"The Witch of Shadows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514640/a6c9b1c151caa97cb423fec6e29ddf9d47c3089d.jpg"},{"name":"Judge the Fake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514640/a3607987d9e70f0d254a898cb14c498e0e58feca.jpg"},{"name":"Royal of Poker Royale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514640/846242750e91f64de83c7e2c9d82da2aaceb0566.jpg"},{"name":"Champion of Champions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514640/ca7d978d12319b0be6f12ea8b3fdc10bd6dedf47.jpg"},{"name":"Luck Takes Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514640/061cb993ae6a685685a58b97cea69357a784ff8e.jpg"},{"name":"Practice Makes Perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514640/061cb993ae6a685685a58b97cea69357a784ff8e.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2514640?t=1744618033","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744618033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744618033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744618033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3143590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<i>\u2026Bet your all, may victory be yours.</i><br><br>In this game, you adventure to become a successful gambler by challenging others at the game of Texas Hold\u2018em Poker.<br><br>Use various skills to achieve victory in poker, expose the hands of the witches, All-in to steal their winnings, and become the ruler of the gambling district.<br><br>\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Poker Battles</h2>An &quot;anything goes&quot; Texas Hold'em style 1v1 poker-like card game. <br>Become victorious by reducing the enemy chips to 0.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/0a6c794565358e8e65f88ad70e4bfd39.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/0a6c794565358e8e65f88ad70e4bfd39.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ACTIVATE SKILLS</strong></li></ul>The \u201cgambling prodigy\u201d Asuha is capable of turning the tides of battle using various skills, sourcing from her aptitude in gambling.<br>Limit the opponent\u2019s play, gain insight beyond their hand, and much more\u2026 stay victorious with skills that expand the pool of decision-making.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/73c5e4bad8345cbcca295eae8d9759d7.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/73c5e4bad8345cbcca295eae8d9759d7.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/0a1b9c76f5b90426ad0a94d04caeaf2d.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/0a1b9c76f5b90426ad0a94d04caeaf2d.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ALL-IN</strong></li></ul>\u201cAll-In\u201d is a command that puts all chips on the table and your life as a gambler on the line.<br>Use various means to put yourself in a favorable position, and use this command to slam the final nail in the coffin.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/affa16791d05a3f648fa05ede1c6d29b.poster.avif?t=1744618033\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/affa16791d05a3f648fa05ede1c6d29b.webm?t=1744618033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/affa16791d05a3f648fa05ede1c6d29b.mp4?t=1744618033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Showdown vs The Witches</h2>A \u201cWitch\u201d is a Boss Character present in each chapter of the game.<br>All Witches excel at poker, but with enough preparation, the player can expose the Witches\u2019 fraudulent acts and sink them to the depths of hell with a deadly All-In.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/cb19201ca346bea712b7ec7e79b28a7f.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/cb19201ca346bea712b7ec7e79b28a7f.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/e540a61b9002455b8ff4f89ecfc4f60a.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/e540a61b9002455b8ff4f89ecfc4f60a.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>THE CITY</strong></li></ul>The scene is set in The City, where various information can be gathered.<br>Find sources to help unveil the secrets behind the Witches\u2019 cheats and frauds to achieve sweet vengeance.<br>Additionally, you can hustle the gamblers around town to rake in quick cash, or go on a winning streak in \u201cPoker Royale\u201d\u2014which rewards you after achieving a set number of victories\u2014to earn the points needed for acquiring new skills and to obtain rare items, thereby increasing your standing as a gambler.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/62d57546696d38cde9244925c86bb87e.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/62d57546696d38cde9244925c86bb87e.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>The only appropriate sequel to cashing out, is to spend big. <br>Your earnings can be spent deservingly at &quot;club ALL OUT&quot; to party your heart out. <br>Should you catch lady luck's eye, you will be treated to bonus luck for your next battle.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>EXPOSE THE WITCHES\u2019 HAND</strong></li></ul>Your finesse in poker may earn you some cash in The City, but the Witches - who rule the districts, will not allow for a fair victory. Their methods of cheating seems to be fool-proof, but the evidence you uncover will say otherwise.<br>Explore every inch of the city and expose the cheaters of their tricks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/855e8b08e200dbac3ed5c9b12c04f02d.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/855e8b08e200dbac3ed5c9b12c04f02d.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/d4fa74b2949d50b64cec09b305372280.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/d4fa74b2949d50b64cec09b305372280.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=450 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>Asuha Senahara, a self-proclaimed genius gambler, is a wanderer.<br>Amidst the tables of cards and dice, it is she alone who snatches the chips at stake.<br>One day, she learns of the gambling district \u201cthe city\u201d, a special ward where gambling holds influence above all else.<br>In this city run by the strongest gamblers known as the \u201cWitches\u201d, Asuha experiences the first defeat in her life.<br>They exercised not luck, not skill, but dirty tricks, such that felled Asuha to the depths of the abyss.<br>As a self-proclaimed genius gambler, Asuha becomes determined to take down the Witches.<br>The Coliseum is the battlefield. The challenger is Asuha Senahara. The chips are on the table, and the Witches are ready to be exposed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Asuha Senahara</strong></li></ul>Self-proclaimed genius gambler. A failure of a human being, but has a strong resolve and is determined when it comes to gambling. A pretty young lady on the cover, a middle-aged old man on the inside.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/13fa6ac47e26a6510814ae49011176da.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/13fa6ac47e26a6510814ae49011176da.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=986 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Mina Nosaka</strong></li></ul>A girl who saved Asuha after her defeat against the witch.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/19c5ad22c2be6a35db3a07717138ee97.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/19c5ad22c2be6a35db3a07717138ee97.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=1133 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Ulu Amamino</strong></li></ul>The First Witch. Uses her mysterious powers to easily defeat Asuha.<br>Loves snacks and sweets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/ca81f625a7ddaedd5db1b605470015d9.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/ca81f625a7ddaedd5db1b605470015d9.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=1133 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Yuragi Tenraku</strong></li></ul>The Second Witch. Full of maternal warmth, yet subtly tinged with madness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/61fc8e070cb4ef64e3e227af88002112.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/61fc8e070cb4ef64e3e227af88002112.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=1133 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Lancille Kareido</strong></li></ul>The Third Witch. A lively and outgoing personality, embodying the ultimate &quot;gal&quot; vibe. <br>Serves as the warden of a forced labor facility.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras/58e3dc53290fd513cf3da3e087b62559.avif?t=1744618033\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/extras_big/58e3dc53290fd513cf3da3e087b62559.avif?t=1744618033 width=800 height=1133 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><strong>Planning &amp; Development</strong> ACQUIRE (developers of \u201cOctopath Traveler\u201d)<br><strong>Scenario</strong> Shusei Sakagami (Scenario of \u201cHeaven Burns Red\u201d)<br><strong>Art/b] \u85e4\u7530\u5ddd\u6674\u662d<br><strong>BGM</strong>\u3000Feryquitous<br><strong>Production</strong> WSS Playground (Planning &amp; Production of \u201cNEEDY STREAMER OVERLOAD\u201d)</strong>","developers":["ACQUIRE Corp.","WSS playground"],"dlc":[3405060],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514640/header.jpg?t=1744618033","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Alliance Arts Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2514640/866861/bbef986b0c1e7337c1c8c502710fb91b9b6ddfdf/1750816141/dash_a